			(property "Description" "Single-cell Li-Ion/Li-Polymer battery protection IC, SOT-23-6: overcharge detection 4.30V (release 4.10V), overdischarge detection 2.40V (release 3.0V), overcurrent detection ~150mV across an external sense FET. Drives two external N-channel MOSFETs (see FS8205A) via the OD/OC gate-control outputs. Pin numbers verified directly against the real Fortune Semiconductor datasheet DW01A-DS-12_EN Rev 1.2, Section 6 'Pin Configuration and Package Marking Information': 1=OD, 2=CS, 3=OC, 4=TD, 5=VCC, 6=GND."
